. *----------------------------------------------------------------------------
> --*
. **# 18.8 Optional additional diagnostic: district-adjusted descriptive regres
> sions
. *----------------------------------------------------------------------------
> --*
. * These are not causal models. They simply check whether origin differences r
> emain
. * after absorbing district-level average differences.
. *----------------------------------------------------------------------------
> --*
. 
. tempfile origin_regressions

. tempname regpost

. 
. postfile `regpost' ///
>     str80 outcome ///
>     str160 label ///
>     long n ///
>     double coef_prev_contacted ///
>     double se ///
>     double p_value ///
>     double mean_new ///
>     double mean_prev ///
>     using `origin_regressions', replace
